name: count_of
---

# count_of

How many cells of the list equal `x` under Soil's structural equality
on `F64` (design §3.7) — the multiset view `is_permutation` is built
on. Equality is total, so `NaN` cells count like any other value.

```soil-sig
count_of : (xs : List F64) -> (x : F64) -> I64
```

```test counts
([1.0, 2.0, 1.0], 1.0) => 2
([1.0, 2.0], 3.0) => 0
([], 1.0) => 0
(["NaN", 1.0, "NaN"], "NaN") => 2
```
